.Dd November 23, 2026
.Dt OPENDIFF 1
.Os Minkar
.Sh NAME
.Nm opendiff
.Nd show two files' differences
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar file1 file2
.Op Fl ancestor Ar ancestorFile
.Op Fl merge Ar mergeFile
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
opens the differences between
.Ar file1
and
.Ar file2
(two directories: all their files') in Text Editor, as a unified diff it
highlights.
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl merge Ar mergeFile
Merge the two into
.Ar mergeFile
and open it instead.
With
.Fl ancestor ,
each side's changes from the ancestor are kept and only those they both
make are marked as conflicts; without it, every difference is marked
.Pq Ql <<<<<<< , Ql ======= , Ql >>>>>>>
for the user to resolve.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr diff 1 ,
.Xr diff3 1
